        "text": "Page: Shanghai Knights. Sentence: Directed by David Dobkin and written by Alfred Gough and Miles Millar, it stars Jackie Chan and Owen Wilson.\nPage: Owen Wilson. Sentence: He starred with Ben Stiller in numerous films, and is known for his roles in Frat Pack comedies and as well as voicing Lightning McQueen in the \"Cars\" franchise.\nPage: Tom Wu. Sentence: He is a martial arts expert who has appeared in films such as \"Revolver\", \"Shanghai Knights\", \"Batman Begins\" and the Bollywood sci-fi movie \"Ra.One\".\nPage: The Big Year. Sentence: The Big Year is a 2011 American comedy film directed by David Frankel, written by Howard Franklin and starring Jack Black, Steve Martin, and Owen Wilson.",
